WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.075 --> 00:00:18.459
Tom went to get his wand.

2
00:00:18.460 --> 00:00:22.000
"Poor Princess Mary," he thought.

3
00:00:22.001 --> 00:00:26.235
"She is so kind and beautiful.

4
00:00:26.236 --> 00:00:34.648
I must make some pinkberries appear!"

5
00:00:34.649 --> 00:00:36.979
"Cat?" Tom called.

6
00:00:36.980 --> 00:00:41.484
There was no answer.

7
00:00:41.485 --> 00:00:45.491
Tom got his wand.

8
00:00:45.492 --> 00:00:49.584
"Pinkberries, appear!" he cried.

9
00:00:49.585 --> 00:01:00.199
Poof! A pink elephant appeared.

10
00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:05.810
Poof! Poof! Poof!

11
00:01:05.811 --> 00:01:11.730
Tom waved his wand again and again and again.

12
00:01:11.731 --> 00:01:17.763
Dirk burst into the lab.

13
00:01:17.764 --> 00:01:20.848
"Where are those pinkberries?"

14
00:01:20.849 --> 00:01:25.610
"I, um, need more time," Tom said.

15
00:01:25.611 --> 00:01:28.274
"You fool!" Dirk cried.

16
00:01:28.275 --> 00:01:30.712
"The princess is very sick!

17
00:01:30.713 --> 00:01:34.807
We need those berries now!"

18
00:01:34.808 --> 00:01:37.942
Dirk stared hard at Tom.

19
00:01:37.943 --> 00:01:40.467
"I have one idea.

20
00:01:40.468 --> 00:01:43.535
There's a tale about a pinkberry bush.

21
00:01:43.536 --> 00:01:46.621
It's in the Dark Forest."

22
00:01:46.622 --> 00:01:51.388
Tom gulped. "The Dark Forest?"

23
00:01:51.389 --> 00:01:53.280
Dirk nodded.

24
00:01:53.281 --> 00:01:57.051
"They say the bush grows all year long.

25
00:01:57.052 --> 00:01:59.797
Perhaps you can find it."

26
00:01:59.798 --> 00:02:04.327
Tom opened his mouth. "But—"

27
00:02:04.328 --> 00:02:14.980
Dirk pushed him outside. "Go now!"

28
00:02:14.981 --> 00:02:21.776
Tom stepped into the Dark Forest.

29
00:02:21.777 --> 00:02:37.831
He walked past tall trees and twisting vines.

30
00:02:37.832 --> 00:02:42.011
His boots sank into the mud.

31
00:02:42.012 --> 00:02:45.360
Hiss! Croak! Hoot!

32
00:02:45.361 --> 00:02:49.242
Spooky sounds filled the air.

33
00:02:49.243 --> 00:02:52.152
Then a bat flew over Tom's head.

34
00:02:52.153 --> 00:02:56.028
"Agh!" He waved the bat away.

35
00:02:56.029 --> 00:03:00.272
"Oops!" Tom cried as his wand flew through the air.

36
00:03:00.273 --> 00:03:02.668
The wand landed in the mud.

37
00:03:02.669 --> 00:03:12.852
Then it began to sink!
